## Charts

`charts/` holds the [mozaic](https://github.com/samizdata-co/mozaic) charts: one folder per chart in `charts/src/charts/`, built as static embeds and print files. It installs mozaic {% if mozaic_path %}from the local checkout in `{{ mozaic_path }}` (build it there with `pnpm --filter mozaic package`){% else %}from npm (`@samizdata/mozaic`){% endif %}.

```bash
cd charts
pnpm install
pnpm dev       # preview every chart at http://localhost:5173
pnpm check     # type-check
pnpm build     # static embeds in output/charts/build/
pnpm export    # SVG, PDF and PNG in output/charts/exports/ (needs a Chromium)
```

Write the data each chart needs to `charts/data/` (committed; `data/processed/` is not). The house style is `charts/src/lib/theme.ts`{% if outlet != 'none' %}, which uses the copy of the outlet's brand in `charts/src/lib/brands/` (do not edit it; `copier update` brings new brand releases){% endif %}. See `charts/AGENTS.md` for the conventions.

### Publishing charts

{% if outlet == 'zdg' -%}
`pnpm upload` in `charts/` builds the charts and publishes them at <{{ grafice_url }}{{ project_slug }}/>, the Worker that serves every ZdG story's charts. It needs the [`grafice`](https://github.com/ziaruldegarda/grafice) repo cloned next to this project (or `GRAFICE_DIR` set to its path, with `pnpm install` run there once): its `scripts/publish.ts` copies `output/charts/build/` to `public/{{ project_slug }}/`, deploys with `cf deploy` and commits. `baseUrl` in `charts/mozaic.config.ts` is already that address, so the preview page there shows the embed codes to paste into the article. Each chart is at `embed/<slug>/<locale>/`; its embed code is an iframe plus `embed.js`, which resizes the iframe to fit the chart.
{%- else -%}
`pnpm build` in `charts/` writes the charts as static files to `output/charts/build/`, next to the rendered docs in `output/`; upload that folder (or all of `output/`) to any static host. Set `baseUrl` in `charts/mozaic.config.ts` to the public URL, so the preview page shows the right embed codes. Each chart is at `embed/<slug>/<locale>/`; its embed code is an iframe plus `embed.js`, which resizes the iframe to fit the chart.
{%- endif %}
